{% set name = entry.name %}
Loupe's pagination. {{ entry.summary }}

```jsx
<{{ name }} page={2} totalPages={7} pageList={[1, 2, 3, null, 7]} hrefFor={(page) => '/documents?page=' + page} />
```

Pass `pageList` with `null` for a gap. The labels are English: "Page 2 of 7", "Previous page" and "Next page". The component draws nothing when `totalPages` is 1 or less. It emits the real `{{ entry.rootClass }}` classes of the app.
